      "writtenOn": "2023-04-17T14:56:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I had a bug propagating the requirement flags up the node hierarchy (it was using the children\u0027s ShaderSnippet\u0027s requirements, but not taking into account grandchildren, etc.)  So in the compose shader GMs, there were ShaderNode trees where it was the grandchildren that needed local coords but the root thought there were none required and then the fragment shader only ever sampled at (0,0).",
