      "writtenOn": "2023-04-17T14:56:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "SkTDArray was already included from the header so figured I wouldn\u0027t bring in another container. But switching to SkSTArray would mean getRootNodes() can avoid heap allocations (since the upper bound on roots is known), and it looks like now SkTArray\u0027s clear() preserves the allocation, which it didn\u0027t use to and was the original motivation for using SkTDArray in PaintParamsKey. I will just switch to that.",
